					<div class="icon-list-wrapper"><ul class="nav flex-column vertical-icon-list"><li class="icon-parent"><span class=" icon-dark ti-check-box"></span>Secure an appropriate degree of protection for consumers</li><li class="icon-parent"><span class=" icon-dark ti-check-box"></span>Maintain fair, orderly, efficient, transparent and reliable capital markets</li><li class="icon-parent"><span class=" icon-dark ti-check-box"></span>Facilitate capital formation, deepening and development of the capital markets industry</li><li class="icon-parent"><span class=" icon-dark ti-check-box"></span>We enhance the proper functioning of capital market systems while promoting effective competition that benefits consumers</li><li class="icon-parent"><span class=" icon-dark ti-check-box"></span>Reduce systemic risk</li></ul></div><!-- .icon-list-wrapper -->				</div>
